WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.120 --> 01:42.474
=Episode 8=
(A Rainy Day Not So Annoying)

01:49.792 --> 01:51.352
I heard someone across the street

01:51.551 --> 01:52.392
bit a dog.

01:52.591 --> 01:54.671
No, the dog bit the person.

01:55.151 --> 01:55.992
Hurry, check it out.

01:56.352 --> 01:57.511
There must be some news.

01:57.711 --> 01:58.631
Okay, investigate it.

01:58.872 --> 02:00.031
Okay.

02:10.591 --> 02:11.191
What's up?

02:12.071 --> 02:12.591
Nothing.

02:12.872 --> 02:14.511
Let me see your hand.

02:21.511 --> 02:22.671
Hurry and remove it.

02:23.792 --> 02:25.031
Don't let your dad see.

02:25.720 --> 02:26.138
Okay.

02:33.832 --> 02:34.671
Come with me.

02:36.832 --> 02:37.832
Come with me.

02:40.631 --> 02:41.432
Are you okay?

02:42.752 --> 02:43.432
I'm okay.

02:51.912 --> 02:52.631
Zhi.

02:53.231 --> 02:54.752
This is Chen Luzhou's mom.

02:57.511 --> 02:59.352
You always said that she sounded

02:59.352 --> 03:00.551
like Ms. Lin.

03:00.551 --> 03:01.472
I didn't believe it.

03:01.992 --> 03:04.151
When she spoke, I was lost.

03:06.191 --> 03:06.952
How is it?

03:07.071 --> 03:08.711
Meeting the person you've longed to see.

03:08.872 --> 03:09.912
How do you feel?

03:10.832 --> 03:12.111
I always felt

03:12.992 --> 03:14.472
that she was very similar to my mom.

03:14.792 --> 03:15.952
But after seeing her today,

03:16.111 --> 03:17.432
I now feel she isn't

03:17.432 --> 03:18.631
similar to my mom at all.

03:37.312 --> 03:38.312
You're back.

03:40.952 --> 03:41.792
What's wrong?

03:51.231 --> 03:52.352
Playing in the water again?

03:54.312 --> 03:54.992
Seriously.

03:56.432 --> 03:57.671
How many pairs are worn out?

03:58.671 --> 04:00.312
It was only bought a few days ago.

04:08.472 --> 04:09.711
You're even feeling wronged?

04:25.752 --> 04:27.151
(If you play in the water again,)

04:27.151 --> 04:28.591
(then you'll go to school barefoot.)

04:57.352 --> 05:00.191
Although my mom always scolded me,

05:00.591 --> 05:04.191
she always forgave my mistakes.

05:05.231 --> 05:07.191
Ms. Lin is sharp-tongued,
but soft-hearted.

05:07.472 --> 05:08.591
Chen Luzhou's mom

05:08.912 --> 05:10.832
speaks softly,

05:11.151 --> 05:12.671
but is quite aggressive,

05:12.952 --> 05:14.151
causing slight suffocation.

05:15.312 --> 05:18.752
Is it because Chen Luzhou was adopted,

05:19.272 --> 05:21.231
that she used a favor as leverage?

05:22.231 --> 05:24.272
Although my dad often scolds me,

05:24.671 --> 05:25.912
I still like him.

05:32.111 --> 05:33.432
(No wonder he would say that)

05:33.912 --> 05:35.272
(being unconditionally loved)

05:35.591 --> 05:36.912
(requires a bit of luck.)

05:37.711 --> 05:39.031
I've spoken with your dad.

05:39.752 --> 05:41.031
The school professors

05:41.031 --> 05:42.312
are quite satisfied with you.

05:42.671 --> 05:44.191
Now it's just the visa required.

05:44.992 --> 05:46.631
After I'm done being busy these days,

05:46.711 --> 05:48.071
I'll go to the consulate with you.

05:55.711 --> 05:57.071
I'll make a wish.

05:57.631 --> 05:58.631
Come on.

06:03.111 --> 06:04.111
Can I not go abroad?

06:07.752 --> 06:09.792
This has been planned for a long time.

06:09.792 --> 06:11.031
Now you say you don't want it?

06:11.031 --> 06:14.992
I don't have to go to Hua University.
Any university nationwide will work.

06:15.711 --> 06:17.031
A less popular major is fine.

06:19.191 --> 06:19.912
Chen Luzhou.

06:21.031 --> 06:22.832
Sending you abroad is good for you.

06:22.992 --> 06:24.111
Not an exile.

06:24.432 --> 06:26.031
Don't make yourself feel so aggrieved.

06:26.031 --> 06:26.551
Alright?

06:27.312 --> 06:28.792
If you're not at ease, it's okay.

06:29.711 --> 06:31.191
I can sign a guarantee letter.

06:31.671 --> 06:33.671
I promise not to take anything
from Chen Jishen,

06:34.752 --> 06:36.151
as long as I can stay here.

06:37.272 --> 06:38.912
What nonsense are you talking about?

06:40.432 --> 06:41.872
Even if your dad changes his mind,

06:41.952 --> 06:42.912
I still won't agree.

06:43.432 --> 06:43.912
Hui.

06:44.191 --> 06:45.472
We have some shots ready here.

06:45.472 --> 06:46.511
Come over and take a look.

06:47.031 --> 06:48.392
Okay, I'm coming over right away.

06:51.952 --> 06:53.151
As for that girl,

06:53.631 --> 06:55.031
I still say the same thing.

06:55.031 --> 06:56.472
Regardless of your relationship,

06:56.912 --> 06:58.792
it's best to end it before going abroad.

07:01.151 --> 07:02.031
Do you understand?

07:09.432 --> 07:12.432
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

07:47.962 --> 07:50.039
(Convenience Store)

08:00.352 --> 08:01.832
Boss, here's the money.

08:04.631 --> 08:05.231
Be careful.

09:16.712 --> 09:17.952
Chen Luzhou's phone.

09:19.271 --> 09:20.271
It's also wet.

09:20.672 --> 09:21.512
Take a look quickly.

09:29.792 --> 09:30.471
Here.

09:32.191 --> 09:32.672
This...

09:33.952 --> 09:35.632
Now you have what I have.

09:38.071 --> 09:38.912
Good luck.

09:49.151 --> 09:50.031
You go home first.

09:50.391 --> 09:51.832
I'll take his phone to him.

09:52.231 --> 09:53.992
How can you do it in such heavy rain?

09:54.191 --> 09:55.832
No problem, I have an umbrella.

09:56.471 --> 09:57.151
Here.

09:57.632 --> 09:58.672
Hold this for me.

09:58.672 --> 09:59.191
I'll pack it.

10:03.752 --> 10:06.231
CLZ, Chen Luzhou.

10:07.872 --> 10:08.592
Zhi.

10:08.912 --> 10:10.431
You know what a crush is?

10:11.111 --> 10:12.151
It means

10:12.471 --> 10:14.912
even though it's
a rainy day you dislike,

10:15.191 --> 10:17.071
you'll still go without hesitation

10:17.071 --> 10:18.752
to take the phone to him.

10:24.031 --> 10:24.992
How's business?

10:24.992 --> 10:26.031
Mr. Xu.

10:26.351 --> 10:27.271
Why are you here?

10:28.071 --> 10:29.752
I had to come and see

10:29.832 --> 10:31.111
you two lively entrepreneurs.

10:31.391 --> 10:33.071
Welcome.

10:33.792 --> 10:36.632
I just heard about a phone
not being taken.

10:36.992 --> 10:37.792
Chen Luzhou's?

10:38.031 --> 10:38.752
No, it's not.

10:38.992 --> 10:40.952
A customer who got a manicure.

10:40.952 --> 10:41.992
She left her phone here.

10:42.311 --> 10:43.031
A woman?

10:44.632 --> 10:45.832
Mr. Xu, you're really funny.

10:45.832 --> 10:48.351
How could it possibly
be a man getting a manicure?

10:50.431 --> 10:51.071
True.

10:51.512 --> 10:52.512
Well then.

10:52.752 --> 10:54.431
Dad, could you put this away for me?

10:55.552 --> 10:56.231
- Bye.
- Bye.

11:19.096 --> 11:22.056
♪On a midsummer night♪

11:22.968 --> 11:27.429
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

11:29.272 --> 11:32.504
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

11:33.272 --> 11:37.881
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

11:39.416 --> 11:41.799
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

11:41.976 --> 11:44.280
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

11:44.664 --> 11:46.884
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

11:46.884 --> 11:49.312
♪The whole world pauses♪

11:50.424 --> 11:52.842
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

11:55.061 --> 11:56.638
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

11:57.728 --> 12:00.183
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

12:00.274 --> 12:02.146
♪Falling into your eyes♪

12:05.343 --> 12:06.968
♪Billions of raindrops♪

12:07.928 --> 12:10.440
♪Like the universe's response♪

12:10.520 --> 12:12.472
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

12:23.320 --> 12:26.763
♪We met across billions of light-years♪

12:37.112 --> 12:39.172
♪Drizzling rippled into waves♪

12:40.170 --> 12:42.061
♪The answer also begins to clear♪

12:43.736 --> 12:47.012
♪Foreshadowed by an umbrella♪

12:48.184 --> 12:51.000
♪An ending stretching far away♪

12:52.920 --> 12:56.339
♪Reuniting in this familiar rain♪

12:56.536 --> 12:58.507
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

12:59.192 --> 13:01.123
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

13:01.794 --> 13:04.395
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

13:04.504 --> 13:06.574
♪The whole world pauses♪

13:07.512 --> 13:10.215
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

13:24.992 --> 13:26.231
You forgot your phone.

13:26.992 --> 13:27.512
Thank you.

13:29.351 --> 13:30.592
You went drinking?

13:32.471 --> 13:33.512
You are upset?

13:35.592 --> 13:37.431
No, I've gotten used to it.

13:46.792 --> 13:47.512
You have a fever.

13:48.191 --> 13:49.391
Do you have a thermometer?

13:51.351 --> 13:52.471
Got anything else to do?

13:55.191 --> 13:56.552
If you want to see my mom,

13:57.071 --> 13:58.552
I haven't decided how to tell her.

13:59.992 --> 14:00.952
You saw it too.

14:01.271 --> 14:02.712
She's not someone easily dealt with.

14:04.111 --> 14:04.912
Never mind.

14:05.952 --> 14:07.311
I'm not here to see your mom.

14:08.111 --> 14:09.592
I'm here to tell you a joke.

14:09.912 --> 14:10.752
It's about you.

14:12.111 --> 14:13.311
Can I not listen?

14:14.351 --> 14:15.431
Really not going to listen?

14:19.431 --> 14:20.111
Go ahead.

14:21.191 --> 14:23.512
Thanks to you, I honored
the Childbirth Buddha last time.

14:23.912 --> 14:25.111
Xu found out about this.

14:25.512 --> 14:27.311
He nearly thought
I was carrying your child,

14:27.391 --> 14:28.632
and was ready to stab you.

14:29.872 --> 14:30.712
I stopped him.

14:32.191 --> 14:33.311
Then I must thank you.

14:33.912 --> 14:34.912
Don't mention it.

14:35.391 --> 14:37.151
I need mental distress

14:37.151 --> 14:38.311
compensation from you.

14:39.311 --> 14:41.191
I was chased by him with a knife.

14:41.632 --> 14:42.471
What did you lose?

14:43.712 --> 14:45.672
Xu nags at me every day, telling me

14:45.672 --> 14:47.031
to stay away from bad guys.

14:47.391 --> 14:48.431
I've been at my wits' end

14:48.431 --> 14:49.672
in dealing with him.

14:52.471 --> 14:53.752
Alright, go ahead.

14:54.351 --> 14:55.448
How much do you want?

14:55.768 --> 14:57.016
How much do you have?

14:57.111 --> 14:58.752
I have five million. Do you want it?

14:59.552 --> 15:00.271
Yes, if legal.

15:01.471 --> 15:03.391
It's hard to make
such a large sum legal,

15:03.872 --> 15:04.592
unless married.

15:06.592 --> 15:07.471
That won't work.

15:08.431 --> 15:09.632
You're even picky about that?

15:09.952 --> 15:11.792
We're not of marriageable age yet.

15:13.271 --> 15:14.471
Even at that age, I won't.

15:14.792 --> 15:16.592
Marriage is a very serious matter.

15:17.552 --> 15:19.552
I didn't expect you
to be so traditional.

15:21.632 --> 15:23.391
So, don't flirt
with me casually anymore.

15:24.271 --> 15:25.872
I don't want to misunderstand you again.

15:50.632 --> 15:51.712
(We applied screen films,)

15:51.832 --> 15:53.431
(and had the first financial success.)

15:58.672 --> 16:00.832
(Congratulations to Lucy
for bouncing back.)

16:01.512 --> 16:03.952
(Thanks to Jiang for treating us again.)

16:06.832 --> 16:08.071
The lark.

16:09.792 --> 16:10.471
It's her again.

16:17.111 --> 16:18.071
Take a look.

16:19.031 --> 16:19.752
Don't cross.

16:19.992 --> 16:22.271
- I see you doing it solo.
- Look at me, impressive?

16:22.431 --> 16:24.071
Nice.

16:24.632 --> 16:25.471
Come on, solo kill.

16:25.592 --> 16:26.712
- Nice, cool.
- Impressive?

16:26.712 --> 16:27.351
Yes.

16:27.672 --> 16:28.552
Hold off.

16:28.552 --> 16:29.231
Hold off.

16:29.231 --> 16:30.271
Just go for the dragon.

16:30.471 --> 16:31.672
- Got it.
- Go for the dragon.

16:32.552 --> 16:34.168
Nice, Zhu.

16:34.952 --> 16:37.151
(Are you planning
to bail on last time's hotpot?)

16:37.151 --> 16:38.111
(The kind Zhu.)

16:38.111 --> 16:39.071
Got the middle tower.

16:39.752 --> 16:41.752
(Who said I bailed?
I'll treat you next time.)

16:50.231 --> 16:51.872
Hurry up, someone, go check.

16:51.872 --> 16:52.672
They all went over.

16:52.672 --> 16:55.391
(It's a rainy day, perfect for hotpot)

16:55.592 --> 16:56.391
Don't go AFK.

16:56.471 --> 16:57.952
(Isn't it perfect for gaming?)

16:57.952 --> 16:58.992
Are you a bot, Zhu?

16:58.992 --> 17:00.031
I'm coming.

17:04.391 --> 17:05.752
Why send a location?

17:05.752 --> 17:06.512
It's okay.

17:08.351 --> 17:09.231
What's she doing?

17:09.792 --> 17:11.431
(I'm leaving, don't forget an umbrella.)

17:11.431 --> 17:13.071
It's okay, it's fine.

17:13.431 --> 17:14.471
Ridiculous.

17:14.471 --> 17:15.552
Why should I care?

17:15.712 --> 17:16.592
Don't go AFK.

17:16.792 --> 17:19.191
- Okay. I 'll play well.
- Counting on you, Zhu.

17:19.191 --> 17:20.471
- You're the main position.
- I'll get back here.

17:20.471 --> 17:21.311
Attack him.

17:21.311 --> 17:22.471
Let's protect Zhu this round.

17:22.792 --> 17:23.872
Save me, Jiang Cheng.

17:23.872 --> 17:24.832
Hurry, he's coming!

17:24.832 --> 17:25.912
I can't save you.

17:27.231 --> 17:27.592
Buddies.

17:28.031 --> 17:29.351
I need to leave.

17:30.031 --> 17:31.752
- No. Finish this.
- Finish this.

17:31.872 --> 17:32.552
I can't.

17:34.584 --> 17:36.363
(Paracetamol-Amantadine Capsule)

17:43.512 --> 17:44.351
This is mine.

17:45.752 --> 17:46.672
My cup.

17:47.632 --> 17:48.311
I drank from it.

17:50.031 --> 17:51.592
I didn't notice.

17:53.752 --> 17:55.632
If there's anyone at a loss,
it's me, right?

17:56.632 --> 17:58.271
Then I should be happy?

17:58.832 --> 17:59.712
No need for that.

18:00.792 --> 18:02.151
Remember 5,000 yuan for each kiss?

18:03.512 --> 18:04.351
It's indirect one.

18:04.351 --> 18:05.752
You can just pay 2,500 yuan.

18:06.231 --> 18:07.231
Transfer it to my WeChat.

18:10.391 --> 18:11.191
We're even.

18:12.111 --> 18:13.111
Or have another drink.

18:13.111 --> 18:14.351
You owe me 2,500 yuan.

18:18.672 --> 18:19.872
Are you feeling better?

18:21.592 --> 18:22.752
What else can I do?

18:23.111 --> 18:24.191
Take me for a drive?

18:24.752 --> 18:25.592
The weather is bad.

18:26.952 --> 18:28.952
When the weather clears up,
if I'm still unhappy,

18:29.231 --> 18:30.351
then I'll schedule with you.

18:31.632 --> 18:32.792
Well...

18:33.512 --> 18:35.311
I hope you can cheer up soon.

18:40.151 --> 18:41.071
Let's watch a movie.

18:42.031 --> 18:44.056
I'll get you home when the rain stops.

19:00.672 --> 19:01.712
Go inside and take a nap.

19:05.992 --> 19:06.872
Alright, no problem.

19:08.191 --> 19:10.111
Remember to wake me up
when the rain stops.

19:11.768 --> 19:13.592
Your favorite drink is in the fridge.

19:14.191 --> 19:15.191
Feel free.

19:26.391 --> 19:27.712
Come, have some meat.

19:31.111 --> 19:31.552
Thanks.

19:32.312 --> 19:35.384
What's the relationship between the lark
in No.1 High School and Chen Luzhou?

19:35.952 --> 19:38.992
She was messaging him
and giving him water.

19:39.592 --> 19:41.351
From my observations of Chen Luzhou,

19:41.672 --> 19:43.792
he usually kept his distance from girls.

19:44.712 --> 19:45.872
A perilous feast?

19:47.071 --> 19:48.592
Who send you to ask me? Xu Zhi?

19:49.311 --> 19:51.231
What's wrong with me
looking out for my bestie?

19:52.752 --> 19:53.351
Fine.

19:53.351 --> 19:54.952
We're both supporting the same couple.

19:55.111 --> 19:55.632
Come on.

19:56.832 --> 19:57.872
Stop being so attentive.

19:58.552 --> 19:59.391
Tell me,

19:59.471 --> 20:00.592
what's their relationship?

20:01.431 --> 20:02.471
There's nothing special.

20:02.752 --> 20:04.391
She is Lucy's younger sister.

20:04.872 --> 20:07.311
Then why does Yan Lelin
call Chen Luzhou brother?

20:07.552 --> 20:08.872
How many sisters are there?

20:08.872 --> 20:09.832
Really not many.

20:10.151 --> 20:12.912
The lark is the daughter of Lucy's aunt,

20:13.071 --> 20:14.311
and Luzhou's legitimate cousin.

20:14.752 --> 20:16.191
If you dare to lie to me...

20:18.351 --> 20:19.712
You can ask Chen Xingqi.

20:21.792 --> 20:23.351
Alright, I'll trust you once.

20:23.912 --> 20:24.912
But I have to say,

20:24.912 --> 20:26.752
you're doing a pretty good job
as her bestie.

20:27.992 --> 20:28.672
That's right.

20:28.992 --> 20:30.231
I can't just see Zhi

20:30.231 --> 20:31.191
get hurt by Chen Luzhou.

20:32.231 --> 20:34.191
Not sure who'll be hurt, alright?

20:34.872 --> 20:35.992
Our Lucy

20:36.512 --> 20:39.471
is an innocent and chaste young man.

20:39.792 --> 20:41.071
Innocent?

20:41.832 --> 20:42.992
Don't believe it, do you?

20:43.431 --> 20:44.071
You just wait.

20:48.712 --> 20:49.752
See for yourself.

20:50.672 --> 20:51.351
What's this?

20:52.071 --> 20:53.311
Isn't it just a chair?

20:54.311 --> 20:56.031
No.

20:56.472 --> 20:57.592
I'll send it to you.

21:10.111 --> 21:10.872
(Zhi.)

21:11.111 --> 21:12.071
(Check if there is)

21:12.071 --> 21:13.712
(a small blue chair in Luzhou's place.)

21:15.672 --> 21:16.471
(What?)

21:17.832 --> 21:19.752
(That's the special seat
he prepared for you.)

21:44.471 --> 21:45.952
Text me when you want to hear me

21:46.071 --> 21:46.912
get scolded again.

21:47.632 --> 21:49.071
I will put a chair out there.

21:50.391 --> 21:51.992
I'm sorry.

21:52.712 --> 21:54.351
You said it earlier.

21:54.992 --> 21:56.912
Friend me on WeChat
and put a chair there.

21:57.231 --> 21:58.471
I'm getting a bit tired now.

21:58.471 --> 21:59.912
Can you put a chair here?

22:01.560 --> 22:05.198
♪And you always have me♪

22:05.944 --> 22:07.960
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

22:07.960 --> 22:10.521
♪Remains in the heart♪

22:10.872 --> 22:12.696
♪You will fulfill the past♪

22:12.696 --> 22:14.620
♪Dream you long for♪

22:14.840 --> 22:18.104
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

22:18.264 --> 22:21.208
♪Together with you♪

23:00.672 --> 23:02.672
(I made some ginger tea
on the coffee table.)

23:02.952 --> 23:04.311
(Drink some when you wake up.)

23:04.712 --> 23:05.992
(When I used to have a cold,)

23:05.992 --> 23:07.111
(my mom would make this.)

23:07.311 --> 23:08.031
(It really works.)

23:09.351 --> 23:09.912
(PS.)

23:10.952 --> 23:12.151
(Here's nail polish remover.)

23:12.271 --> 23:14.592
(Remember to remove the manicure
and rhinestones tomorrow.)

23:15.192 --> 23:19.610
♪The world is too quiet♪

23:21.592 --> 23:27.824
♪Amplify every sound♪

23:29.496 --> 23:32.696
♪Who will visit me♪

23:35.640 --> 23:40.461
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

23:41.944 --> 23:45.001
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

23:45.176 --> 23:47.592
♪into caring and concern♪

23:47.592 --> 23:48.872
(PS.)

23:49.271 --> 23:50.471
(Finally, this is for you.)

23:51.071 --> 23:52.992
(There is no real despair,)

23:52.992 --> 23:55.351
(only prisoners of their thoughts.)

23:56.088 --> 24:00.022
♪Watch the stars rise and fall♪

24:01.688 --> 24:07.384
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

24:08.920 --> 24:10.424
(There is no real despair,
only prisoners of their thoughts.)

24:10.424 --> 24:11.151
(Chen Luzhou)

24:12.536 --> 24:18.743
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

24:19.288 --> 24:21.976
♪The lonely clock♪

24:22.392 --> 24:26.340
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

24:27.416 --> 24:30.408
♪Are we both♪

24:31.000 --> 24:34.279
♪Attracted to each other♪

24:35.704 --> 24:41.336
♪Falling into you♪

25:13.912 --> 25:16.071
(Is this the difference of life?)

25:16.592 --> 25:18.872
(Last night, I was)

25:18.872 --> 25:22.071
(having a feast
at upscale Shan Fang Hotpot.)

25:22.311 --> 25:23.231
(You unlucky person)

25:23.231 --> 25:24.672
(can only have ginger tea at home.)

25:24.792 --> 25:26.680
(Only country bumpkin
goes to Shan Fang Hotpot.)

25:27.191 --> 25:28.431
(Right. You are romantic.)

25:28.552 --> 25:30.512
(You go swinging while on the toilet.)

25:47.071 --> 25:47.952
What are you doing?

25:48.600 --> 25:50.231
Get a new broadband service.

25:50.231 --> 25:51.271
Won't you check the score?

25:51.471 --> 25:52.952
I'll boost the internet speed,

25:53.431 --> 25:54.912
and ensure you can check it promptly.

25:55.351 --> 25:55.992
We will have

25:56.271 --> 25:57.351
gigabit fiber optic.

25:57.792 --> 26:00.151
After turning it on,
the speed is extremely fast.

26:04.984 --> 26:06.648
Why the one behind it is not lit?

26:10.552 --> 26:11.712
This backfires so quickly.

26:12.552 --> 26:13.271
Don't move.

26:14.351 --> 26:15.231
I'll go check.

26:27.992 --> 26:28.752
(What's up?)

26:30.552 --> 26:32.271
(My dad is afraid
the network is too slow.)

26:32.271 --> 26:33.471
(He upgraded the fiber optic,)

26:33.752 --> 26:35.111
(but failed to set up the router.)

26:35.111 --> 26:36.231
(The circuit is faulty now.)

26:37.351 --> 26:38.712
Your dad is really something.

26:39.311 --> 26:41.592
It's not easy for you
to have grown up smoothly.

26:46.872 --> 26:47.952
The flashlight is too dim.

26:50.071 --> 26:50.792
Pay attention.

27:11.391 --> 27:12.311
(Are you angry?)

27:14.191 --> 27:15.912
(I only see it now.)

27:19.191 --> 27:21.632
(I thought I mentioned your family
and you got upset.)

27:24.872 --> 27:25.632
(I am not angry.)

27:26.111 --> 27:27.552
(It's not that easy to get angry.)

27:27.832 --> 27:28.471
(True.)

27:29.231 --> 27:30.952
(I don't think I've seen you get angry.)

27:31.752 --> 27:34.992
(So, what exactly
would make you lose temper?)

27:37.151 --> 27:38.191
(You can try.)

27:42.271 --> 27:43.512
(You have nothing to do.)

27:47.271 --> 27:47.872
It's lit.

27:52.031 --> 27:53.471
(Or else why chat with you?)

28:01.712 --> 28:03.872
(I'm just your tool to kill time.)

28:04.111 --> 28:05.912
(I won't make ginger tea for a tool.)

28:06.872 --> 28:07.592
(Is that so?)

28:08.592 --> 28:10.151
(What were you thinking last night?)

28:11.391 --> 28:13.151
(Why not write
a three-thousand-word essay)

28:13.151 --> 28:15.672
- (to analyze inner thoughts in detail?)
- I want to get warranty support.

28:15.792 --> 28:17.071
- (Xu Tianluo.)
- The router.

28:17.391 --> 28:18.391
Right.

28:19.471 --> 28:21.031
The one behind it is not lit.

28:22.431 --> 28:24.471
(Do you know how much
gigabit fiber optic costs?)

28:27.512 --> 28:30.832
(Over a thousand a year.
I can't remember clearly.)

28:30.992 --> 28:32.231
Just come and take a look.

28:34.231 --> 28:35.992
(Xu really loves me the most.)

28:36.512 --> 28:38.752
(Grandma had internet lags
while playing poker online.)

28:38.992 --> 28:40.552
(He didn't want to upgrade the fiber.)

28:41.031 --> 28:42.752
(So, about making ginger tea,)

28:42.832 --> 28:44.760
(I can't write
a three-thousand-word essay.)

28:44.832 --> 28:47.071
(But if I ever spend money on you,)

28:47.071 --> 28:49.512
(I'll write an eight-thousand-word essay
to reproach you.)

28:49.512 --> 28:50.992
(You don't need to rush.)

28:53.151 --> 28:53.811
- (Better be.)
- No way.

28:53.811 --> 28:55.552
We're checking the score today.

28:56.376 --> 28:57.880
Tomorrow just won't work.

28:58.512 --> 28:59.672
Can you think of a way?

29:00.351 --> 29:01.031
Yeah.

29:02.672 --> 29:03.391
Alright.

29:04.632 --> 29:05.231
Alright.

29:06.872 --> 29:08.152
What did support team say?

29:08.512 --> 29:10.488
They said today
there were many broadband issues.

29:10.912 --> 29:11.872
No one can come help.

29:14.952 --> 29:15.872
It's already 10 AM.

29:16.311 --> 29:18.104
Support team would be too late, right?

29:20.311 --> 29:21.191
It's okay.

29:21.391 --> 29:22.592
Checking the results

29:22.752 --> 29:23.752
sooner or later is same.

29:23.832 --> 29:25.391
I'll use data, and you'll make a call.

29:25.391 --> 29:25.992
It's fine.

29:26.992 --> 29:28.592
Right, I'll make the call.

29:29.031 --> 29:29.952
You check it out.

29:54.231 --> 29:54.872
Zhi.

29:55.912 --> 29:56.872
Today, I shouldn't be

29:57.872 --> 29:59.391
doing things at the last minute.

29:59.552 --> 30:00.872
- It's okay.
- I messed up.

30:00.872 --> 30:02.752
Don't worry, I have a helper.

30:10.191 --> 30:11.111
Hello, what's up?

30:11.471 --> 30:12.632
Emergency rescue.

30:13.111 --> 30:14.351
I can't fix circuits.

30:14.471 --> 30:15.512
School didn't teach this.

30:16.191 --> 30:18.191
The circuit's fixed,
but the network is down.

30:18.712 --> 30:20.512
That grade-checking website won't load.

30:20.672 --> 30:21.792
The call won't connect.

30:22.071 --> 30:23.191
Dad is collapsing.

30:23.391 --> 30:25.712
If you don't mind,
send me the exam admission ticket.

30:25.712 --> 30:26.512
I'll help you check.

30:26.912 --> 30:27.592
I don't mind.

30:27.792 --> 30:29.271
I even feel a bit guilty.

30:29.552 --> 30:31.952
I want to make ginger tea
for you right away.

30:34.752 --> 30:35.151
Alright.

30:36.031 --> 30:37.151
Whoever skips is a puppy.

30:48.088 --> 30:49.191
I'm at the internet cafe.

30:49.191 --> 30:49.752
Wait a bit.

30:50.431 --> 30:51.231
How is it?

30:51.552 --> 30:53.231
Just 680. I can't attend Hua University.

30:53.592 --> 30:54.271
Chen Luzhou.

30:54.592 --> 30:56.391
Honestly, you're so handsome

30:57.832 --> 30:58.592
and

30:58.832 --> 30:59.752
considerate.

31:00.111 --> 31:03.271
Surely many girls in China
will pursue you.

31:03.552 --> 31:05.031
But you're about to go abroad.

31:05.311 --> 31:06.872
Girls abroad might not

31:06.872 --> 31:07.992
like you.

31:09.351 --> 31:10.752
No need to worry about that.

31:11.592 --> 31:13.191
I should be popular wherever I go.

31:14.471 --> 31:15.311
Shameless.

31:20.952 --> 31:22.712
You haven't turned on the computer?

31:23.391 --> 31:23.992
Nervous?

31:24.912 --> 31:25.271
Frankly,

31:25.271 --> 31:27.031
I was bolder when I was a child.

31:27.552 --> 31:29.471
Our school held a cultural performance.

31:29.752 --> 31:31.832
I was supposed to go on stage
to conduct a chorus.

31:32.311 --> 31:36.151
But the teacher gave me a quick lesson,
and then I went on stage.

31:36.471 --> 31:38.111
Actually, I'm quite tone-deaf.

31:38.431 --> 31:40.111
But I was not afraid
of being embarrassed.

31:40.872 --> 31:42.391
I went up and conducted blindly.

31:42.752 --> 31:44.952
In the end, everyone sang correctly.

31:45.431 --> 31:46.431
Later I found out

31:46.632 --> 31:47.832
they didn't look at me.

31:47.832 --> 31:49.191
They looked at the teacher behind.

31:49.832 --> 31:50.952
So, you still went up there?

31:52.391 --> 31:53.351
Because I looked good.

31:53.792 --> 31:55.071
The judges liked looking at me.

31:56.872 --> 31:57.752
How should I put it?

31:57.912 --> 31:58.992
I can't say more.

31:59.512 --> 32:00.872
As a showpiece, I was top-notch.

32:01.832 --> 32:02.552
Alright.

32:03.952 --> 32:04.672
Being shameless,

32:04.672 --> 32:05.712
you and I are on par.

32:06.311 --> 32:07.552
What's your certificate number?

32:14.111 --> 32:15.391
I sent the information to you.

32:16.752 --> 32:18.712
If it is less than 680,
then don't tell me.

32:20.151 --> 32:21.240
With Optional Module?

32:21.311 --> 32:21.872
Of course.

32:22.071 --> 32:23.752
I performed better in it.

32:23.992 --> 32:26.111
I scored 690 in the third mock exam.

32:26.632 --> 32:28.592
That score aren't reliable references.

32:29.431 --> 32:31.592
It is just to boost your confidence.

32:31.992 --> 32:33.391
The exam is simplified.

32:34.968 --> 32:36.603
(Name, Xu Zhi)

32:37.730 --> 32:39.256
(Total science score)

32:39.256 --> 32:41.016
(Provincial ranking. Total score
of College Entrance Examination)

32:46.512 --> 32:48.471
Hey, why aren't you speaking?

32:53.080 --> 32:54.712
Wait for the call from Hua University.

32:54.712 --> 32:56.431
With Optional Module, it's 738.

32:57.391 --> 32:59.391
Congratulations in advance,
Architect Xu.

33:00.111 --> 33:01.031
Really?

33:03.191 --> 33:04.912
What about you? Have you checked yours?

33:07.896 --> 33:09.400
(Search Exit)

33:14.351 --> 33:15.071
You want to know?

33:16.512 --> 33:17.552
Do you want to say?

33:24.231 --> 33:25.391
It's okay if you don't.

33:25.391 --> 33:26.391
You're going abroad.

33:28.716 --> 33:31.655
(College Entrance Examination Results Inquiry:
Chen Luzhou 713)

33:34.271 --> 33:35.311
Seven hundred thirteen.

33:36.832 --> 33:37.912
Well done.

33:38.832 --> 33:39.512
It's okay.

33:40.231 --> 33:41.592
If it's less than 750,

33:41.592 --> 33:42.552
then it's a failure.

33:43.512 --> 33:45.552
You people at No.1 High School
are really crazy.

33:47.872 --> 33:48.672
Chen Luzhou.

33:50.592 --> 33:52.512
Could you help check
another one's score?

33:53.592 --> 33:55.592
He really helped me a lot with my study.

33:56.231 --> 33:57.231
I just want to see

33:57.231 --> 33:58.752
which course exactly had a problem?

34:00.431 --> 34:01.191
No need to explain.

34:02.752 --> 34:03.752
Send me the information.

34:06.712 --> 34:07.311
Forget it.

34:07.872 --> 34:10.680
Checking others' scores
without permission seems a bit unethical.

34:12.111 --> 34:12.552
Up to you.

34:13.552 --> 34:14.552
Then I'll hang up now.

34:15.191 --> 34:16.912
Xu is still anxious outside.

34:17.031 --> 34:18.071
Thank you for today.

34:33.832 --> 34:35.952
(Well done, Xu Zhi)

34:47.231 --> 34:47.832
How was it?

34:48.632 --> 34:49.688
You checked it?

34:51.391 --> 34:51.992
How is it?

34:57.912 --> 34:59.912
Qingyi University
is actually quite good.

35:00.151 --> 35:01.992
See, you can also stay here.

35:02.271 --> 35:03.632
You can build your hometown,

35:03.872 --> 35:06.031
and also close to me,
as well as our place.

35:06.391 --> 35:09.311
The electric blanket I bought last time
can be used now.

35:09.552 --> 35:10.071
That's good.

35:11.952 --> 35:13.752
Then it might not be usable.

35:18.471 --> 35:19.391
You can go to Beijing?

35:21.271 --> 35:21.832
How is it?

35:22.231 --> 35:23.712
Seven hundred and thirty-eight.

35:24.592 --> 35:26.151
Seven hundred and thirty-eight.

35:26.351 --> 35:27.912
Barring accidents, it should be fine.

35:31.471 --> 35:32.832
Seven hundred and thirty-eight.

35:32.992 --> 35:36.191
My daughter will attend Hua University.

35:40.592 --> 35:42.031
Am I too excited?

35:43.271 --> 35:44.952
If your mom knew,

35:46.111 --> 35:47.552
she would also be very happy.

35:50.712 --> 35:51.912
You did so well.

35:54.231 --> 35:56.672
We definitely must hold
a big celebration banquet.

35:56.832 --> 35:59.552
Invite everyone we know over

35:59.632 --> 36:01.031
to celebrate for you together.

36:01.431 --> 36:02.151
No need for that.

36:02.512 --> 36:03.712
The application isn't done.

36:04.592 --> 36:06.271
Let's not get happy too soon.

36:07.752 --> 36:08.512
That's right.

36:11.191 --> 36:12.752
Keep things discreet to succeed.

36:19.231 --> 36:20.111
Go to the right.

36:20.672 --> 36:22.231
- Right.
- Go to the right with me.

36:22.552 --> 36:23.191
Not enough.

36:26.832 --> 36:27.752
Go to the right.

36:27.952 --> 36:29.391
I went right, and you blame me.

36:32.592 --> 36:34.752
I heard Xu Zhi
was their school's top scorer.

36:35.231 --> 36:36.111
You know the score?

36:37.111 --> 36:37.832
I don't know.

36:41.431 --> 36:42.071
But still,

36:43.031 --> 36:44.231
the top scorer at Ruijun

36:44.391 --> 36:44.952
probably

36:44.952 --> 36:46.391
is average at No.1 High School.

36:48.191 --> 36:48.712
Wanna bet?

36:49.471 --> 36:50.111
Bet on what?

36:51.031 --> 36:52.992
With her score,
even in No.1 High School,

36:53.111 --> 36:54.712
she would definitely be among the top.

36:56.912 --> 36:57.552
Oh.

37:00.712 --> 37:01.624
You ordered takeout?

37:01.832 --> 37:02.391
I'll go.

37:03.311 --> 37:04.592
Nice, I'm just hungry.

37:04.992 --> 37:05.952
I'll start a game.

37:07.912 --> 37:08.792
Your takeout.

37:11.231 --> 37:12.071
I didn't order.

37:12.471 --> 37:13.512
You did.

37:14.271 --> 37:15.071
Wrong address?

37:22.431 --> 37:23.071
What's this?

37:23.071 --> 37:23.792
Good stuff.

37:26.552 --> 37:27.992
If Zhu Yangqi opened the door,

37:28.151 --> 37:29.752
your head would've been smashed.

37:30.111 --> 37:31.431
If he opened the door for me,

37:31.431 --> 37:33.111
I'd leave right away.

37:33.712 --> 37:35.391
Then why are you here, Architect Xu?

37:35.552 --> 37:37.111
I'd be a puppy if I didn't come.

37:38.552 --> 37:39.992
You came to make me ginger tea.

37:40.351 --> 37:42.431
I came to discuss my application.

37:43.672 --> 37:45.512
I no longer consider Qingyi University.

37:45.512 --> 37:46.872
But Beijing is too far.

37:47.191 --> 37:48.632
How about going to Shanghai?

37:48.632 --> 37:51.792
Tech University's School of Architecture
is second only to Hua University.

37:51.792 --> 37:52.912
Moreover,

37:52.992 --> 37:55.832
a train ticket to Beijing
costs 680 yuan.

37:56.191 --> 37:58.071
It costs only 180 yuan
to go to Shanghai.

38:00.071 --> 38:00.832
I don't suggest

38:01.471 --> 38:03.431
to choose a school
based on train ticket prices.

38:05.351 --> 38:08.191
Your eyelashes are so long.

38:10.431 --> 38:12.431
Why discuss eyelashes?

38:13.592 --> 38:14.992
What was that girl's name again?

38:15.391 --> 38:16.471
Xu Zhi, right?

38:16.832 --> 38:17.752
Stop arguing.

38:18.031 --> 38:19.792
Alright, let's go.

38:20.111 --> 38:21.151
Really.

38:28.552 --> 38:29.632
Look at them.

38:30.111 --> 38:31.952
They even led our Tan Xu astray.

38:32.592 --> 38:34.912
Young people nowadays
are really shameless.

38:35.712 --> 38:37.752
I suggested earlier
that the kid stayed home.

38:37.792 --> 38:40.311
But you insisted all the students
here are high school seniors.

38:40.311 --> 38:41.391
Study atmosphere is good.

38:41.672 --> 38:42.471
Isn't it your fault?

38:42.632 --> 38:43.431
Alright.

38:44.191 --> 38:45.632
I'll cancel the lease tomorrow.

38:45.832 --> 38:46.351
Let's go.

38:46.351 --> 38:47.632
I won't return here.

38:47.832 --> 38:52.166
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

38:52.672 --> 38:54.151
She said you're shameless.

38:54.296 --> 38:55.760
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

38:56.111 --> 38:57.351
Who caused the trouble?

38:59.231 --> 39:01.191
I have nothing to do with him.

39:01.624 --> 39:03.941
♪The whole world pauses♪

39:04.728 --> 39:07.124
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

39:09.464 --> 39:11.553
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

39:11.928 --> 39:14.336
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

39:14.936 --> 39:16.443
♪Falling into your eyes♪

39:17.231 --> 39:18.952
Shall we celebrate with Xu Zhi

39:18.952 --> 39:19.752
and Cai Yingying?

39:23.191 --> 39:23.872
Sorry.

39:34.672 --> 39:35.992
You're quite fast.

39:35.992 --> 39:36.992
You called Xu Zhi.

39:37.471 --> 39:38.512
Only Cai Yingying is left.

39:38.912 --> 39:40.471
I think Yingying didn't do quite well.

39:40.792 --> 39:42.792
She doesn't seem like someone
who didn't do well.

39:43.311 --> 39:43.912
I'll show you.

39:46.311 --> 39:48.031
(Celebrate, we must celebrate.)

39:48.231 --> 39:49.351
(I'm coming right now.)

39:53.111 --> 39:53.792
I'll call her.

39:54.912 --> 39:55.632
Let's wait inside.

39:55.800 --> 39:56.600
Let's go.

40:06.712 --> 40:07.912
Come on, cheers.

40:08.311 --> 40:09.471
Come on, cheers.

40:13.496 --> 40:15.640
Have you decided
which university to apply?

40:18.071 --> 40:19.151
I think

40:19.512 --> 40:21.071
Hua University or Tech University.

40:21.191 --> 40:22.200
I haven't decided.

40:23.712 --> 40:24.391
As for me,

40:24.632 --> 40:26.992
no hope applying
to the Central Academy of Fine Arts.

40:27.632 --> 40:29.391
I should apply to Academy
of Theater Arts.

40:30.391 --> 40:32.071
It also has an art major?

40:32.872 --> 40:33.592
You don't know.

40:33.592 --> 40:35.271
That's called stage art major.

40:36.712 --> 40:38.031
We both scored 400.

40:38.104 --> 40:39.864
You can attend
a top university in Beijing,

40:39.992 --> 40:41.632
but I can't.

40:41.952 --> 40:43.071
How is this so unfair?

40:44.071 --> 40:44.992
I just have high HP.

40:46.832 --> 40:47.792
Let me play.

40:48.311 --> 40:49.271
I'm dying.

40:49.672 --> 40:51.071
Don't you have high HP?

40:51.071 --> 40:52.672
Let me finish this game.

40:56.191 --> 40:58.952
I won't be able to get into college,
and you still won't let me play.

41:03.191 --> 41:04.471
Alright, here you go.

41:04.592 --> 41:05.271
Can you play?

41:07.231 --> 41:09.071
You die right when you start playing.

41:10.431 --> 41:10.872
Rightward.

41:10.872 --> 41:11.952
I know.

41:12.391 --> 41:13.431
Press this.

41:14.031 --> 41:14.752
I'll teach you.

41:14.752 --> 41:15.592
Let's talk inside.

41:15.832 --> 41:16.351
Don't fly.

41:16.712 --> 41:17.512
Let's talk inside.

41:18.191 --> 41:19.471
Your screen is gone. Look.

41:19.471 --> 41:21.752
No, hurry, adjust it back.

41:23.632 --> 41:25.672
Come on. My left hand, your right hand.

41:25.672 --> 41:26.191
I want that.

41:26.351 --> 41:27.271
I want that skin.

41:27.271 --> 41:27.912
That skin.

41:27.912 --> 41:29.720
Adjust like this. I'll help you adjust.

41:31.992 --> 41:32.552
Just sit.

41:39.512 --> 41:40.471
For me?

41:40.632 --> 41:41.111
Thank you.

41:41.912 --> 41:43.431
I just stocked some at home.

41:51.231 --> 41:53.151
I reviewed previous admission scores.

41:53.311 --> 41:54.752
Hua University should be fine.

41:54.752 --> 41:56.792
But the School of Architecture
at Hua University

